    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_005_01_B:005_01_B_015:a177bbf7",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C01_005_01_B",
        "key": "005_01_B_015",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_005_01_B:005_01_B_015:a177bbf7",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_005_01_B:005_01_B_015:a177bbf7",
        "jp_sha256": "8e689a45da3f18648965c266dba56b0f77101f7947bd227488620f415f67a07d",
        "official_en_sha256": "0bb6378e8c63d24582106d94bc7ad2f55ce3b05a900ab68b02feae55039b0a54"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ。\r\n神殿のクリスタルに何もなければ\r\nいいのだが……。",
        "official_en": "Indeed. I can only hope that my suspicions are unwarranted, and the enshrined Crystal is undisturbed.",
        "real_en": "Yes. I just hope nothing has happened to the Crystal in the shrine..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
