        "official_en_sha256": "003df47ce15c6ff3411bd8fc807af51ee35de286170b7c88d03e7d994b0944e1"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いざ言えと言われると\r\n意外と出てこないものだな、願いとは。",
        "official_en": "Hm... Now that I’m on the spot, I cannot think of any.",
        "real_en": null
      },
