      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いっぱいあるぜ。\r\n美味しいものが食べたいとか、\r\n優しい女の子に出会えますように、とか。",
        "official_en": "Oh, I’ve got tons of things I want to wish for. Like good food and meeting a nice girl.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
