        "official_en_sha256": "14d01fe83febefdd9b71de1adecc97ba7b68d5067479ae1320bdfcbfdd47d206"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いや、つい嫌なことばかりが\r\n思い浮かんでしまってな。",
        "official_en": "No, it’s just that...I cannot help but think about these unsettling events.",
        "real_en": "No, it’s just that...I keep thinking of unpleasant things."
