    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_005_01_B:005_01_B_016:e1a6fc48",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C01_005_01_B",
        "key": "005_01_B_016",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_005_01_B:005_01_B_016:e1a6fc48",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_005_01_B:005_01_B_016:e1a6fc48",
        "jp_sha256": "bb08cde168ab6fb594eee5a882710fe2dc77d05fbcc406f6ec1c3d3919794841",
        "official_en_sha256": "d50c703fb71fd38c5eaeebf1f404f68eed94d2af7fb37fa1400b235b91886038"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "じゃ、ラスウェルの願いは\r\nグランシェルトが、変わらず平和でありますようにってとこか。\r\nラスウェルらしくて、いい願いだな。",
        "official_en": "I know, how about this then: let’s say your wish is for lasting peace in Grandshelt. It’s exactly what I’d expect from you, Lasswell—not a bad wish, don’t you think?",
        "real_en": "So your wish would be for Grandshelt to stay at peace, huh? That's just like you, Lasswell. It's a good wish."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
